msgid "A MaxCompute project with valid Access ID / Access Key."
msgstr "需要一个已开通的 MaxCompute 项目，并具备有效的 Access ID / Access Key。"

msgid "Applicable scenarios"
msgstr "适用场景"

msgid "Automatic tagging and management of large video datasets."
msgstr "海量视频数据自动打标与管理。"

msgid ""
"Autonomous driving systems continuously collect large-scale camera video "
"across road types, traffic conditions, weather, and complex events. These"
" raw videos are critical for model training, scenario mining, data "
"flywheel operations, and evaluation."
msgstr ""
"自动驾驶车辆在研发和运营过程中会持续采集海量摄像头视频数据。这些数据覆盖"
"不同道路类型、交通流、天气光照和复杂事件，是模型训练、场景挖掘、数据闭环"
"和效果评测的重要基础。"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景信息"

msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "资源清理"

msgid "Configure Role ARN for OSS mount access."
msgstr "配置用于 OSS 挂载访问的 Role ARN。"

msgid "Custom image"
msgstr "自定义镜像"

msgid "Data preparation for training and evaluation loops."
msgstr "训练、评测与数据闭环支撑。"

msgid "Dataset clustering and distribution analysis."
msgstr "数据聚类分析与分布评估。"

msgid ""
"Default DPE runtime includes Python but not FFmpeg. Stage-1 frame "
"extraction requires FFmpeg binaries."
msgstr ""
"默认 DPE 运行时仅包含 Python，不包含 FFmpeg；阶段一抽帧依赖 FFmpeg "
"可执行文件。"

msgid ""
"Default DPE runtime includes Python but not FFmpeg. Stage-1 frame "
"extraction requires FFmpeg binaries. For a quick validation run, you can "
"reuse an existing verified FFmpeg image from the same region. For "
"production, build and publish your own image in the same region as the "
"MaxCompute project, then set ``odps.session.image`` to that image name."
msgstr ""
"默认 DPE 运行时仅包含 Python，不包含 FFmpeg；阶段一抽帧依赖 FFmpeg "
"可执行文件。快速验证时，可以复用同地域已经验证过的 FFmpeg 镜像。生产环境"
"建议自行构建并发布与 MaxCompute 项目同地域的镜像，然后将 ``odps.session."
"image`` 设置为该镜像名称。"

msgid ""
"Make sure the mounted OSS path is correct before submitting the job. For "
"example, if your OSS address is ``oss://oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com"
"/jingxuan-oss-test-hz/``, use ``OSS_ENDPOINT = \"oss-cn-"
"hangzhou.aliyuncs.com\"``, ``OSS_BUCKET = \"jingxuan-oss-test-hz\"``, and"
" ``OSS_PATH = \"\"`` or the subdirectory that contains your videos."
msgstr ""
"提交任务前，请确认挂载的 OSS path 正确。例如，如果你的 OSS 地址是 ``oss:/"
"/oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/jingxuan-oss-test-hz/``，则设置 ``OSS_"
"ENDPOINT = \"oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com\"``、``OSS_BUCKET = \"jingxuan-"
"oss-test-hz\"``，并将 ``OSS_PATH`` 设为 ``\"\"`` 或实际存放视频的子目录。"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

msgid "Dockerfile example:"
msgstr "Dockerfile 示例："

msgid "Environment setup"
msgstr "环境准备与会话创建"

msgid "Extract keyframes from videos with FFmpeg."
msgstr "视频抽帧：通过 FFmpeg 按指定帧率抽取关键帧图片。"

msgid "Generate scene labels using multimodal LLMs."
msgstr "图片打标：调用百炼多模态大模型自动生成场景标签和语义描述。"

msgid "Global parameters:"
msgstr "全局参数配置："

msgid "Long-tail and anomaly scenario discovery."
msgstr "异常事件与长尾场景发现。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

msgid ""
"Purchase/enable model compute service and confirm the associated "
"inference quota before running Bailian model inference."
msgstr ""
"购买或开通模型计算服务，并在运行百炼模型推理前确认已关联推理配额。"

msgid "Produce embeddings for retrieval, clustering, and sample mining."
msgstr ""
"向量化：提取 Embedding 向量，形成可用于检索、聚类、样本筛选和分析的统一"
"特征底座。"

msgid ""
"Raw video data is usually unstructured and expensive to curate manually. "
"To improve reuse and retrieval efficiency, the data pipeline should "
"standardize frame-level processing:"
msgstr ""
"然而，原始视频通常缺乏结构化标签，人工筛选和整理成本高，导致高价值样本"
"发现难、数据复用效率低。为提升海量视频数据的管理和利用效率，需要对视频"
"进行帧级理解与标准化加工："

msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "条件"

msgid "Similar-scene retrieval and sample recall."
msgstr "相似场景检索与样本召回。"

msgid "Source videos are stored in a target OSS bucket."
msgstr "原始视频已存储在目标 OSS Bucket 中。"

msgid "Stage 1: frame extraction"
msgstr "阶段 1：视频抽帧"

msgid "Stage 2: image labeling"
msgstr "阶段 2：图片打标"

msgid "Stage 3: multimodal embedding"
msgstr "阶段 3：图像向量化"

msgid "Stage-1 extraction requires FFmpeg in MaxCompute custom image."
msgstr "阶段一抽帧需要在 MaxCompute 自定义镜像中预装 FFmpeg。"

msgid ""
"Stage-1 extraction requires FFmpeg in a MaxCompute custom image. The "
"image must be available in the same region as the MaxCompute project."
msgstr ""
"阶段一抽帧需要使用包含 FFmpeg 的 MaxCompute 自定义镜像。该镜像必须和 "
"MaxCompute 项目处于同一地域。"

msgid "This tutorial shows an end-to-end distributed implementation on MaxFrame."
msgstr ""
"本方案依托 MaxFrame 的分布式处理能力，实现视频数据的端到端批量处理，帮助"
"将非结构化视频数据转化为可检索、可分析、可复用的数据资产。"

msgid "Video Pipeline: Frame Extraction -> Labeling -> Embedding"
msgstr "视频处理全流程：抽帧 -> 打标 -> 向量化"

msgid "Video understanding and vectorization pipeline"
msgstr "视频理解与向量化处理流程"

msgid ".. image:: ../_static/examples/video-pipeline.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/examples/video-pipeline-zh.svg"

msgid "Why custom image?"
msgstr "为什么需要自定义镜像？"

msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "方案核心流程"

msgid ""
"Submit a ticket to enable the DPE engine for your MaxCompute project before "
"running this example."
msgstr "运行本示例前，请提工单为当前 MaxCompute 项目开通 DPE 引擎。"

msgid "Model compute service and inference quota"
msgstr "模型计算服务与推理配额"

msgid ""
"In MaxCompute console, purchase/enable model compute service and confirm "
"the associated inference quota before running Bailian model inference."
msgstr ""
"在 MaxCompute 控制台购买或开通模型计算服务，并在运行百炼模型推理前确认已"
"关联推理配额。"

msgid "MaxCompute model compute service and inference quota page"
msgstr "MaxCompute 模型计算服务与推理配额页面"

msgid ".. image:: ../_static/examples/bailian-quota.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/examples/bailian-quota-zh.png"

msgid ""
"Make sure the mounted OSS path is correct before submitting the job. For "
"example, if your OSS address is ``oss://oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com"
"/jingxuan-oss-test-hz/``, use ``OSS_ENDPOINT = \"oss-cn-"
"hangzhou.aliyuncs.com\"``, ``OSS_BUCKET = \"jingxuan-oss-test-hz\"``, and"
" ``OSS_PREFIX`` as the subdirectory that contains your videos."
msgstr ""
"提交任务前，请确认挂载的 OSS 路径正确。例如，如果你的 OSS 地址是 ``oss://"
"oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/jingxuan-oss-test-hz/``，请设置 ``OSS_"
"ENDPOINT = \"oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com\"``、``OSS_BUCKET = \"jingxuan-"
"oss-test-hz\"``，并将 ``OSS_PREFIX`` 设为存放视频的子目录。"

msgid "Stage 0: build video manifest table"
msgstr "阶段 0：构建视频清单表"

msgid ""
"If you already have an ODPS table with a ``video_path`` column, skip this "
"stage. Otherwise, use PyODPS and ``alibabacloud_oss_v2`` to scan the OSS "
"prefix and write one row per video. Stage 1 reads this table directly."
msgstr ""
"如果已经有包含 ``video_path`` 列的 ODPS 表，可以跳过本阶段。否则，使用 "
"PyODPS 和 ``alibabacloud_oss_v2`` 扫描 OSS 前缀，并将每个视频写入一行。"
"阶段 1 会直接读取这张表。"

msgid ""
"The ``video_path`` value must use exactly the same prefix as ``OSS_ROOT`` "
"(``oss://<endpoint>/<bucket>/<prefix>/...``). If the prefixes do not "
"match, ``with_fs_mount`` path replacement may silently miss the file."
msgstr ""
"``video_path`` 的值必须与 ``OSS_ROOT`` 使用完全相同的前缀（``oss://"
"<endpoint>/<bucket>/<prefix>/...``）。如果前缀不一致，``with_fs_mount`` "
"的路径替换可能会静默找不到文件。"

msgid ""
"Stage 1 dispatches the video manifest table with ``mf.apply_chunk``. Each "
"row represents one video. Inside the DPE worker, ``with_fs_mount`` mounts "
"the OSS prefix locally, FFprobe validates the video duration, FFmpeg "
"extracts JPEG frames, and the frames are written back to "
"``<OSS_ROOT>/frames/``."
msgstr ""
"阶段 1 使用 ``mf.apply_chunk`` 派发视频清单表，每行代表一个视频。DPE "
"Worker 内部通过 ``with_fs_mount`` 将 OSS 前缀挂载到本地，使用 FFprobe 校"
"验视频时长，再用 FFmpeg 抽取 JPEG 帧，并将帧写回 ``<OSS_ROOT>/frames/``。"

msgid ""
"The output schema is aligned with the AI FUNC image input contract. "
"Downstream stages can use ``image_id`` and ``image_url`` without renaming "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"输出 schema 与 AI FUNC 图片输入契约对齐。下游阶段可直接使用 ``image_id`` "
"和 ``image_url``，无需重命名列。"

msgid "Column"
msgstr "列"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "``video_path``"
msgstr "``video_path``"

msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

msgid "Source video OSS path for lineage."
msgstr "源视频 OSS 路径，用于 lineage 追溯。"

msgid "``frame_idx``"
msgstr "``frame_idx``"

msgid "bigint"
msgstr "bigint"

msgid "Frame index. Failed rows use ``-1``."
msgstr "帧序号。失败行使用 ``-1``。"

msgid "``image_id``"
msgstr "``image_id``"

msgid "``<video_basename>_<frame_idx:04d>``."
msgstr "``<video_basename>_<frame_idx:04d>``。"

msgid "``image_url``"
msgstr "``image_url``"

msgid "Frame JPEG OSS URL, ready for AI FUNC."
msgstr "帧 JPEG 的 OSS URL，可直接用于 AI FUNC。"

msgid "``status``"
msgstr "``status``"

msgid "``ok`` or ``failed``."
msgstr "``ok`` 或 ``failed``。"

msgid "``error_stage``"
msgstr "``error_stage``"

msgid "Failed stage name."
msgstr "失败阶段名称。"

msgid "``error_msg``"
msgstr "``error_msg``"

msgid "Failed reason."
msgstr "失败原因。"

msgid ""
"Load the multimodal model ``qwen3.6-plus`` through AI FUNC and generate a"
" structured description for each successfully extracted frame."
msgstr ""
"通过 AI FUNC 加载多模态模型 ``qwen3.6-plus``，为每张抽帧成功的图片生成结"
"构化描述。"

msgid ""
"Load the multimodal embedding model, defaulting to ``qwen3-vl-"
"embedding``, and generate image embeddings for successfully labeled "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"加载多模态向量化模型（默认 ``qwen3-vl-embedding``），为打标成功的图片生成"
"图像向量。"
